      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192235955.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192235955.png" 
             alt="" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p><strong>BUUCTF: <a href="https://buuoj.cn/challenges"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://buuoj.cn/challenges</a></strong></p>
<hr>
<p>相关阅读
<a href="https://ctf-wiki.org/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF Wiki</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/mochu7777777/article/details/105412940"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BUUCTF：[WUSTCTF2020]girlfriend</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192238168.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192238168.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交。
感谢 Iven Huang 师傅供题。
比赛平台：https://ctfgame.w-ais.cn/</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>下载附件，得到attachment .zip压缩包，解压后得到girlfriend.zip压缩包。最后材料是girlfriend.wav和题目描述.txt。</p>
<p>题目描述.txt内容如下：

<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192239778.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192239778.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、尝试听girlfriend.wav音频文件，刚开始没有听出是手机键盘拨号声。后面看题解，得知是DTMF拨号音识别。
<strong>Audacity显示</strong>

<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192240867.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192240867.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>使用dtmf2num程序识别拨号内容
<a href="https://link.csdn.net/?from_id=105412940&amp;target=http://aluigi.altervista.org/mytoolz/dtmf2num.zip"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dtmf2num下载地址</a></p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">dtmf2num.exe ..<span class="se">\资</span>料<span class="se">\g</span>irlfriend.wav
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">dtmf2num.exe 音频文件位置
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192242495.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192242495.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>得到如下的按键顺序、次数</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">999*666*88*2*777*33*6*999*4*4444*777*555*333*777*444*33*66*3*7777
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>2、对应手机上九宫格输入，得到最后的字符串为 <code>YOUAREMYGIRLFRIENDS</code></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192244079.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192244079.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span><span class="lnt">11
</span><span class="lnt">12
</span><span class="lnt">13
</span><span class="lnt">14
</span><span class="lnt">15
</span><span class="lnt">16
</span><span class="lnt">17
</span><span class="lnt">18
</span><span class="lnt">19
</span><span class="lnt">20
</span><span class="lnt">21
</span><span class="lnt">22
</span><span class="lnt">23
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">YOUAREMYGIRLFRIENDS
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">999</span>     ---&gt;   y
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">666</span>     ---&gt;   o
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">88</span>      ---&gt;   u
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">2</span>       ---&gt;   a
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">777</span>     ---&gt;   r
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">33</span>      ---&gt;   e
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">6</span>       ---&gt;   m
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">999</span>     ---&gt;   y
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">4</span>       ---&gt;   g
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">4444</span>    ---&gt;   i
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">777</span>     ---&gt;   r
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">555</span>     ---&gt;   l
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">333</span>     ---&gt;   f
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">777</span>     ---&gt;   r
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">444</span>     ---&gt;   i
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">33</span>      ---&gt;   e
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">66</span>      ---&gt;   n
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">3</span>       ---&gt;   d
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">7777</span>    ---&gt;   s
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">youaremygirlfriends
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="flag">flag：</h3>
<p>大写提交不成功，切换小写</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">flag<span class="o">{</span>youaremygirlfriends<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>]]></content:encoded>
